{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53204","headline":"诗偈 二十九 · 庞藴","name":"诗偈 二十九","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"一皮较一皮，孙子不如儿。\n坐禅胜读经，读经胜有爲。\n寻文不识理，弃母养阿姨。\n阿姨是色身，阿娘是法体。\n色身是文字，法入无爲理。\n文字有生灭，无相宛然尔。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"庞藴","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_53204.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53204","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}